@page "/"

<PageTitle>Home | EventEase</PageTitle>

<section class="hero">
    <h1>Welcome to EventEase</h1>
    <p>
        Browse upcoming corporate and social events, view details, register for events,
        and track attendance from one simple Blazor application.
    </p>

    <div class="button-row">
        <NavLink class="button-link" href="/events">Browse Events</NavLink>
        <NavLink class="button-link accent" href="/attendance">View Attendance</NavLink>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="card">
    <h2>Project Features</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Reusable Event Card component with editable fields and two-way binding.</li>
        <li>Routing between event list, details, registration, attendance, and session pages.</li>
        <li>Validation to prevent invalid registration data.</li>
        <li>State management to track user session activity.</li>
        <li>Performance-conscious rendering for event lists.</li>
    </ul>
</section>
